results.description:
ORC Performance is a private, invitation-only running community built on one standard: consistency.

FEATURES
// Track every run — log distance, time, route, and run type
// Weekly leaderboard — see where you rank against the crew
// Club chat — real-time messaging with your fellow members
// Events — upcoming races and group runs in one place
// Member profiles — your full run history and stats
// Push notifications — never miss a chat message

This isn't a casual run club. Membership is earned, not given. ORC holds its members to a higher standard, you either put in the work or you don't belong here.

Invitation only. Apply at orcstandard.com
